  "answer": "D",
  "numerical_answer": "",
  "tolerance": "",
  "solution": "Same distance from rest, so $a_{smooth} = 4\\,a_{rough}$:\n$$g\\sin 45° = 4g(\\sin 45° - \\mu_k\\cos 45°) \\;\\Rightarrow\\; 1 = 4(1 - \\mu_k) \\;\\Rightarrow\\; \\mu_k = 0.75$$",
